usage: feature_sets.py check-env [-h] [--manifest MANIFEST] --set SET --env
                                 ENV [--state STATE] [--deps-url DEPS_URL]

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --manifest MANIFEST  manifest path (default: design/feature-sets.json)
  --set SET            feature-set id, e.g. FS-04
  --env ENV            environment name (dev|staging|prod), used for the
                       default state path
  --state STATE        deployment-state path (default: deployment-
                       state.<env>.json)
  --deps-url DEPS_URL  live /internal/deps URL instead of a state file
